From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yugidraft <yugidraft@localhost>
Date: Wed, 15 Mar 2000 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] core: include Tag partner monsters for SELF_ATTACK

At more than two duelists, EFFECT_SELF_ATTACK includes monsters of every living team member. The attacker stays excluded. EFFECT_ATTACK_ALL keeps its existing gate. FFA has one member per team. Two duelists keep the stock own field list.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UrYy4jjEcbJHKdcVYasfdb
---
 field.cpp | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/field.cpp b/field.cpp
index 5483378..3978d71 100644
--- a/field.cpp
+++ b/field.cpp
@@ -3042,7 +3042,10 @@ int32_t field::get_attack_target(card* pcard, card_vector* v, bool chain_attack,
 				if(atarget != core.attacker)
 					attack_tg.push_back(atarget);
 		if(is_player_affected_by_effect(p, EFFECT_SELF_ATTACK) && (!pcard->is_affected_by_effect(EFFECT_ATTACK_ALL) || !attack_tg.size())) {
-			for(auto& atarget : player[p].list_mzone)
+			card_vector team_mzone_tmp;
+			const auto& team_mzone = n_duelists == 2 ? player[p].list_mzone
+			    : side_cards(p, false, &player_info::list_mzone, team_mzone_tmp);
+			for(auto& atarget : team_mzone)
 				if (atarget != core.attacker)
 					attack_tg.push_back(atarget);
 		}
